# Godot 4+ specific ignores
.godot/
/android/

# Godot-generated import artifacts (regenerated automatically on open)
*.import

# *.uid files (Godot 4.4+) are deliberately NOT ignored here and should stay
# committed — see README.md's own entry for why. They're stable per-script
# identifiers, not a machine-local cache like .godot/ or *.import above; an
# editor newer than this project's own 4.3 baseline needs them to resolve
# every class_name reference on first open without a project-wide mass
# first-time generation pass (which is what the README entry documents
# actually going wrong for this project specifically).
